================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
================================================================================

The MIT licence above covers the source in this repository. It does not cover
the third-party material below, which keeps its own terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Face artwork — firmware/faces/*.png
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Designed by rawpixel.com / Freepik — https://www.freepik.com

The 36 face masks in `firmware/faces/` are derived from a Freepik emoji set,
obtained under a paid Freepik subscription. They are one-bit renderings of the
original artwork, redrawn for a 320x240 panel.

This attribution must be retained. Anyone redistributing this repository, or
reusing the artwork from it, keeps the credit to rawpixel.com / Freepik and is
bound by the Freepik licence terms rather than by the MIT licence above:

  https://www.freepik.com/terms_of_use

If you fork this project for redistribution and cannot meet those terms, replace
`firmware/faces/` with artwork of your own. Nothing else in the project depends
on that specific set: `firmware/emotion_profiles.h` addresses the faces by index
and supplies colour at draw time, so any 36 one-bit masks of the same size work.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hardware documentation — knowledge/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files under `knowledge/` are M5Stack product documentation, reproduced
verbatim as a fixed reference for the hardware this firmware drives. They remain
the property of M5Stack Technology Co., Ltd. and are included for reference only.

  https://docs.m5stack.com

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendor components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The firmware pins external ESPHome components from m5stack/esphome-yaml and from
n-IA-hane/esphome-audio-stack. They are fetched at build time, not vendored here,
and carry their own licences.
